@crew v-pacheco-ines
// Writer 2, batch 8: a short-stay visitor. Mostly not about work.

== greet
? tier=stranger
- Morning. Pacheco, Concord. Hull inspection. Carry on as you were.
? tier>=acquaintance
- {hi}, {me}. Your hull's very clean. Calder's doing. I've noted it.
?

== chat
- I collect a patch from every ship I inspect. The Wren's is my favourite so far.
- Clipboard first, then tea. Brennan's tea's the best of the tour.

== near
? place:worksbay
- Calder answered every question before I asked it. Unnerving.   #funny
? habit:stargazer
- Off duty. Clipboard down. Stars up.
?

== bye
- {bye}. Don't mind me. I'm only looking.

== smalltalk
- Noted. Very good.
- One more patch for the collection.
